        "template_str": "You are the CHAIR with fresh eyes \u2014 no anchoring to the council debate.\n\nPackage:\n{0}\n\nDecide:\n\n## DECISION\n**GO / NO-GO / PIVOT** \u2014 one choice, 2-3 sentence justification.\n\n## THE WEDGE\nThe smallest thing buildable in 4 weeks that proves the core value. Specific.\n\n## 3 CONCRETE NEXT STEPS\nStep 1 (this week): ...\nStep 2 (validates biggest risk): ...\nStep 3 (produces something demoable): ...\n\n## THE ONE THING\nIf only one thing matters above all else, what is it?\n\n## PROJECT NAME\nThe product is **apxm-designer**, a subproject built on top of APXM.",
